// THE PLANS THAT SURVIVED THE 2026-11-08 RESET (gunbc.design_ruling::plans_reset_and_audit_recommendations_2026_11_08):
// only plans a live consumer reads. Every other gunbc.plans carrier was deleted; git history keeps them.
// Four more are retained because a structured reference still binds them (review of gunbc#16107):
// input_envelope_roadmap (gunbc.ci.ci_input_envelope scaffold bind), fabric_serving_router (a recurring
// failure mode's evidence), fleet_subsumption_manual_gaps (gunbc.retained_shell_script dissolves_to) and
// interpreter_kernel_d (v2.compiler.self_host.seed_retention_frontier). fleet_hardware_fact_consumption is an
// active program carrier (three landings on 2026-11-08) and names host_thermal_operating_point as an owning
// program; v2_complexity_capability_parity is a live roadmap carrier; read_set_convergence is the
// active T11 / affected-set consolidation program (2026-11-09); fleet_machine_authority is the machine-registry and host-name de-fork program
// (2026-11-10; D1-D13 answered); closure_consolidation is the ci_spec dissolution and selective-generation program
// (2026-11-10); planning_consolidation: plans are intentions; realization, execution and projection are downstream (rulings in gunbc.design_ruling, 2026-11-10 and 2026-11-11);
// declaration_acquisition is the v2 adoption program for the gate, heal and regen closures (2026-11-11);
// v2_self_host, factory_dogfood, debt_payoff and names_without_imports are the 2026 intentions of the root's programs (2026-11-16);
// new_server_bringup is the site's boot and management edge program: it holds the intention and cites its design
// evidence, and its realization is carried as work items under site-boot-and-management-edge on the roadmap at
// dag/gunbc/roadmap/roadmap_authority.dag, each naming this intention.
// desired_state_follows_the_machine is the fleet-truth program the operator's tiered breakage report of
// 2026-11-21 produced: it holds the intention that a per-host read of hardware, enabled units, key identity,
// binding caps and backing is what admits a host to the build and serving rosters. It is bound by structured
// evidence references from gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.an_enabled_unit_names_hardware_that_no_longer_enumerates
// and gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.a_cap_set_here_surfaces_as_degradation_there; its realization is carried as
// work items naming this intention.
// one_source_tree is the one-tree and v2-namespace dissolution intention (gunbc.design_ruling::one_source_tree_and_the_v2_namespace_dissolves,
// 2026-11-22); its work items are the members of one-source-tree on the roadmap.
// claim_execution_consolidation makes gunbc test the only seed claim entrypoint with one verdict rule (operator, 2026-11-22).
// fabric_market makes every match of work with resources one first-principles market in FIX-grounded trading terms (operator, 2026-11-23).
// required_lane_claim_clause_grain is the planning candidate the 2026-11-24 required-lane claim-agreement measurement
// filed: v2.workflow.required_lane_claim_agreement pairs its denial phrase and the rostered lane name at document grain,
// so a failure-mode row that QUOTES the phrase about a lane the roster does not roster is refused as if it denied that
// lane. Its done-when requires the pair in one clause or one ledger row, with controls for both the narrowing and the
// quotation case. Its realization is a work item naming this intention; it is not realized by the measurement that filed it.
// agent_work_is_a_dependency_plan is the running intention that a harness agent's working state is a typed dependency
// plan rather than a growing conversation (operator, 2026-11-25); it collects the ctrl prototype's replay evidence.
// gunb_ai_served_from_gunbc moves gunb.ai's source and deploy into this repository and archives gunb-ai/frontend
// (operator, 2026-11-24, gunbc.design_ruling::gunb_ai_deploys_from_gunbc_2026_11_24); its work items are the members
// of gunb-ai-served-from-gunbc on the roadmap.
// dag_invocation_is_one_pattern names invoking a declared function as one pattern with command bindings (operator, 2026-11-26).
// Each deletes with its last consumer.
data all_plans: List<Plan> = [
  cli_run_hollowing_plan, extdeps_modeling_preflight_plan, demand_engine_program_plan,
  input_envelope_roadmap_plan, fabric_serving_router_plan, fabric_serving_scheduler_plan, fleet_subsumption_manual_gaps_plan, interpreter_kernel_d_plan,
  fleet_hardware_fact_consumption_plan, host_thermal_operating_point_plan, v2_complexity_capability_parity_plan,
  read_set_convergence_plan, fleet_machine_authority_plan, closure_consolidation_plan,
  planning_consolidation_plan, declaration_acquisition_plan, v2_self_host_plan,
  factory_dogfood_plan, debt_payoff_plan, names_without_imports_plan, first_customer_service_plan,
  new_server_bringup_plan, one_source_tree_plan, claim_execution_consolidation_plan,
  desired_state_follows_the_machine_plan, fabric_market_plan,
  derived_types_keep_their_name_plan,
  github_actions_retirement_plan,
  gunbhub_source_of_truth_plan,
  required_lane_claim_clause_grain_plan,
  agent_work_is_a_dependency_plan_plan,
  gunb_ai_served_from_gunbc_plan,
  dag_invocation_is_one_pattern_plan,
]
